["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Princess Who Swallowed a Glass Piano glass delusion melancholia House of Wittelsbach\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-07-stuffmissed-她坚信自己吞下了一整架玻璃钢琴-这种妄想曾在欧洲流行数百年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">18:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>她堅信自己吞下了一整架玻璃鋼琴，這種妄想曾在歐洲流行數百年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">從中世紀到19世紀初，歐洲反覆出現「我是玻璃做的」這種妄想——法國國王查理六世不許人碰，御醫曾放火燒床逼病人跳起來「治癒」他。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">歷史</span><span class=\"tag\">精神疾病史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"銳評國模與 Neo Lab，暢談 RL 人生與 RLaaS | 對談 Mind Lab 首席科學家驍騰 RSI LoRA harness discount factor GRPO\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-07-zhangjing-大厂做不出最好的模型-不是技术问题-是账本问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e1cd1b4b05d9c6c1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"4\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">42章經</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>大廠做不出最好的模型：不是技術問題，是賬本問題</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">驍騰認為大廠的問題不是缺卡缺錢，而是財務賬單逼著管理層把實驗室產出做轉化，這種向心力讓突破性創新很難發生在大廠內部，但它們仍能靠置換算力穩賺錢。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">強化學習</span><span class=\"tag\">後訓練</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Martin Wolf on Democratic Capitalism After Trump competitive authoritarianism dirty democracy positional goods citizens&#x27; assembly rentier\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-07-goodfight-专家阶层自毁信誉的代价-没人能再管住会-终结人类-的ai/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>專家階層自毀信譽的代價：沒人能再管住會「終結人類」的AI</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">沃爾夫說，知識分子階層已被民粹政治打垮，以至於連Anthropic自己披露「可能終結人類」的風險都無人深究。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">民主衰退</span><span class=\"tag\">AI存在性風險</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Mark Hyman’s Guide to Living Longer and Staying Strong Peptide Plasmapheresis Urolithin A\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-07-a16z-肌肉是长寿的硬通货-glp-1减重药正在悄悄拿走它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">30:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>肌肉是長壽的硬通貨：GLP-1減重藥正在悄悄拿走它</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Hyman說肌肉是決定衰弱與否的關鍵資產，而當下流行的GLP-1減重藥在讓人瘦的同時大量流失肌肉，這才是真正該警惕的副作用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">長壽醫學</span><span class=\"tag\">蛋白質與肌肉</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1372: Clinical Update with Dr. Daniel Griffin low-dose naltrexone (LDN) target trial emulation screwworm parosmia / phantosmia autochthonous\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-07-twiv-美国时隔三十年再现麻疹死亡-疫苗怀疑论政策付出代价/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>美國時隔三十年再現麻疹死亡：疫苗懷疑論政策付出代價</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">本週美國報告三例本可用疫苗完全預防的麻疹死亡——紐約州三十年來首例、威斯康星州三十六年來首例——Daniel Griffin 把這歸咎於衛生高層散布的疫苗錯誤信息，而不是單純的公共衛生運氣不好。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">麻疹</span><span class=\"tag\">疫苗政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Deep Dive: Anthropic S-1 Myths and Mythos — Jamin Ball, Altimeter S-1 converts Jevons Paradox offtake neocloud compute margin\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-07-latentspace-anthropic招股书最大误读-千亿美元可转债不是欠的债/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c081d94ef2cea125-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:42:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic招股書最大誤讀：千億美元可轉債不是欠的債</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">資產負債表上1080億美元的可轉換票據負債，只是Google、Amazon所持股權隨公司估值暴漲而產生的會計重估，不是真實欠款。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">IPO</span><span class=\"tag\">招股書</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Providing Capital to Tech Companies: Masters In Business with Ann Berry World Models flight to scale Crapification\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-06-mastersinbiz-科技巨头谈ai收购时-估值是聊到最后才被提起的问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>科技巨頭談AI收購時，估值是聊到最後才被提起的問題</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她問科技公司CEO收購AI標的的標準，答案從不主動提價格——這輪競賽裡，佔住位置比算清回報更要緊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI估值</span><span class=\"tag\">私募股權</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"WarTalk: Lame Duck War, No Pete November, Bay of Tofu + Team Yankee NDAA continuing resolution Starshield revealed preference neoprimes\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-06-chinatalk-没有胜利理论的伊朗战争-正在冻结整个国防预算/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/73075358fb273e70-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>沒有勝利理論的伊朗戰爭，正在凍結整個國防預算</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">布萊恩指出，政府從未定義「戰略國家利益」是什麼，所以無法說服國會繼續買單——於是國防授權法案和撥款法案都卡在持續決議裡，直到戰爭以某種方式收場。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">伊朗戰爭</span><span class=\"tag\">國防預算</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"#116 The Hype vs. Data on Saturated Fat, Red Meat, &amp; Seed Oils | Dr. Dariush Mozaffarian GRAS (Generally Recognized As Safe) milk fat globule membrane heme iron resting energy expenditure\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-06-foundmyfitness-饱和脂肪被冤枉-真正的健康风险藏在食物被加工的方式里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3e75b1258b993ca1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">2:43:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">FoundMyFitness</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>飽和脂肪被冤枉：真正的健康風險藏在食物被加工的方式裡</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">同樣含量的飽和脂肪，黃油讓LDL升高，生奶油卻沒有變化——決定健康風險的不是脂肪種類，而是食物被加工、拆解到什麼程度。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">飲食健康</span><span class=\"tag\">飽和脂肪</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Friend Acquisition Rate Pacing the Frontier bunny suit perps gardening leave lockstep compensation\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-06-moneystuff-法律伦理规则让合伙人说走就走-律所比投行更容易崩盘/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c95a1585c224dc58-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">44:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Money Stuff</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>法律倫理規則讓合夥人說走就走，律所比投行更容易崩盤</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">投行靠競業協議和遞延股票鎖人，律所合夥人受律師執業倫理保護、不能被鎖定——這正是Weil Gotshal一夜崩盤、而投行不會的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">預測市場</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Controlling Biology - Fabian Theis, Helmholtz Munich world model bitter lesson organoid flow matching Lab Compass\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-06-latentspace-一场著名的虚拟细胞竞赛爆冷-线性模型打平了多数深度模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c081d94ef2cea125-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">50:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>一場著名的虛擬細胞競賽爆冷：線性模型打平了多數深度模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一場頂級虛擬細胞競賽證明，簡單線性迴歸能打平許多深度學習模型——問題不在數據信息不夠，而在評測指標和訓練目標本身設計有問題。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">虛擬細胞</span><span class=\"tag\">擾動預測</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Brain development in the clinic and the classroom | Karen Parker &amp; Jason Yeatman (with the Future of Everything podcast) RCT Spark\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-06-fromourneurons-教育产品没人做随机对照试验-因为验证了也不赚钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/372ab8e78a5e10ef-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">32:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">From Our Neurons to Yours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>教育產品沒人做隨機對照試驗，因為驗證了也不賺錢</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">學校採購教材靠銷售代表講故事打動老師和學區領導，沒有監管要求證明效果，證明一款產品比另一款好並不會帶來利潤，所以沒人願意出錢去驗證。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">教育科技</span><span class=\"tag\">循證醫學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"E257 對話少楠：明明 AI 有問必答，我怎麼還總是信息焦慮？ OPC OpenClaw Amor fati 鄭州幫 Lindy Effect 式年遷宮\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-06-zhixing-答案越来越便宜-真正稀缺的是选一个下注的勇气/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2ded4f15035f3605-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"知\"><span class=\"dur\">1:15:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">知行小酒館</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>答案越來越便宜，真正稀缺的是選一個下注的勇氣</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">少楠認為，AI讓答案變得唾手可得，但人真正要面對的不是信息匱乏，而是在無窮可能性裡敢不敢選一個、下注、然後把時間交出去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">信息焦慮</span><span class=\"tag\">AI工具</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Inside Salesforce’s $100 Billion M&amp;A Playbook | John Somorjai AOV ISV red teaming outcome-based pricing\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-06-a16z-salesforce并购负责人-好技术没有分销渠道-照样会被饿死/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">49:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>Salesforce併購負責人：好技術沒有分銷渠道，照樣會被餓死</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">John Somorjai說，軟件寫起來比以往更快更便宜，但初創公司要靠自己搭起能觸達全部客戶的銷售網絡，仍要花很多年、不斷稀釋股權——這正是併購對Salesforce和被收購方都成立的價值所在。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業軟件</span><span class=\"tag\">併購</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"America Votes Against Data Centers, Implications for Big Tech and Beyond, Were Google Bears Right All Along? smiling curve Neoclouds Google Capital Company group chat era\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-06-sharptech-选民几乎全票否决数据中心-但赢家大概率还是大厂/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7a309a358a363994-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Sharp Tech</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>選民幾乎全票否決數據中心，但贏家大概率還是大廠</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">44個反對數據中心的地方公投中43個通過，連市長議員都被罷免，但資本、信貸和土地優勢仍集中在亞馬遜、谷歌這類大廠手裡，算力越稀缺它們反而越佔便宜。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">數據中心</span><span class=\"tag\">AI政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Screens in School: What EdTech and AI Are Doing to How Kids Learn transpersonal emergent property NAEP formative vs summative assessment ISIL literacy test\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-06-raisinggh-人手一台校发电脑后-z世代数字素养反而不如千禧一代/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ed6c6b0156a06fc6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">59:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>人手一臺校發電腦後，Z世代數字素養反而不如千禧一代</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">工具在你學會某項技能之前介入，是確保你學不會這項技能的頭號方式——這正是美國88%學生人手一臺校發電腦後，數字素養代際倒退的根源。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">教育科技</span><span class=\"tag\">數字素養</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Reading the Anthropic S-1, with Zvi Mowshowitz S-1 closing the loop pacing the frontier cohort economics net revenue retention bootloader\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-06-complexsys-anthropic三季度放缓不是需求退潮-是算力不够卖/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/20604db48920535f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic三季度放緩不是需求退潮，是算力不夠賣</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">招股書顯示三季度一半算力支出靠5億美元的高價現貨市場填——長約算力早被排滿，不是客戶不想買token了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">IPO招股書</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ramtin Naimi - The State of Venture - [Invest Like the Best, EP.499] cuck tranche NeoLab BCI benchmark maxing\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-06-ilt-风投最赚钱的打法一旦变成共识-可能就不再赚钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0bcdceac3abfefaf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">46:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>風投最賺錢的打法一旦變成共識，可能就不再賺錢</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">當大批VC都擠著當Databricks、Anthropic這類確定性標的的被動股東時，Naimi提醒：歷史上幾乎沒有一種大家都覺得簡單的策略，長期還能跑贏市場。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">一級市場</span><span class=\"tag\">基金募資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Macro Implications of the Blue Tsunami S-1 Dunning-Kruger effect filibuster blue tsunami\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-06-oddlots-建数据中心最积极的几个州-一夜之间全都成了民主党州长/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">37:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>建數據中心最積極的幾個州，一夜之間全都成了民主黨州長</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">從得州到弗吉尼亞，數據中心建設重鎮的州長清一色轉向民主黨，過去默認的稅收優惠和零監管環境正被重新談判。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美國大選</span><span class=\"tag\">數據中心</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Milk Cartons &quot;Scared the Bejesus Out of a Generation&quot; - with Roman Mars Century Safe Bundy clock Taylorism\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-06-cautionary-牛奶盒寻人运动吓坏一代美国人-却没找回一个孩子/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">38:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>牛奶盒尋人運動嚇壞一代美國人，卻沒找回一個孩子</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">牛奶盒上的失蹤兒童照片讓一代美國人提防陌生人綁架，但節目追溯下來，它從未真正幫著找回一個孩子，卻掩蓋了貧困與家暴這些更常見的兒童危險。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">兒童安全</span><span class=\"tag\">泰勒制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"185: Anthropic招股書丨與Amont李肇宇聊定價邏輯和潛在風險 NRR ARR FDE operating lease / financial lease Neo Cloud bare metal\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-06-latetalk-anthropic招股书没敢给的数字-决定了ipo估值天花板/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d307b4093cb28d05-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">59:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">晚點聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic招股書沒敢給的數字，決定了IPO估值天花板</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">招股書迴避了唯一關鍵數字——10月流水；市值能否站上1.5萬億美元，全看這個數字能否撐住年底1000億美元年化收入的外推邏輯。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">企業銷售</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"186: Anthropic招股書丨“銀行也有百億預算”，與Fusion Fund張璐聊大企業在想什麼 Physical AI Net Revenue Retention (NRR) Business Automation / Business Optimization AI for Science\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-06-latetalk-银行ai预算破百亿-却难复制coding的爆发速度/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d307b4093cb28d05-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">晚點聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>銀行AI預算破百億，卻難複製Coding的爆發速度</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">銀行、藥企把AI預算提到史上最高優先級，但張璐認為企業真正改掉工作流程要經歷自動化和優化兩個階段，不可能像寫代碼一樣一年內爆發。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業AI</span><span class=\"tag\">2B投資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"KYC Becomes KYA: Sentinel Bio&#x27;s Joshua Monrad on DNA Screening, Uplift Studies &amp; Agent Monitoring uplift study KYA (Know Your Agent) tacit knowledge managed access regime reverse genetics protocol\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-05-cogrev-病毒合成能力已不缺ai-缺的是机器人的灵巧双手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/708f88bf8d7da201-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:45:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>病毒合成能力已不缺AI，缺的是機器人的靈巧雙手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Monrad認為模型智能已接近夠用，但把設計變成活病毒仍需精細溼實驗操作——這靠機器人的靈巧雙手，現在的機器人還不夠靈巧。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生物安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI風險治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Destroying Tumors With Sound: Histotripsy with Dr. Zhen Xu histotripsy cavitation HIFU (High-Intensity Focused Ultrasound) diffraction limit Golden Goose Award\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-05-fromfirstprinc-超声波震碎肝肿瘤-意外让大鼠体内其它肿瘤自行消失/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfee2881de7968b9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">From First Principles</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>超聲波震碎肝腫瘤，意外讓大鼠體內其它腫瘤自行消失</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大鼠肝腫瘤實驗裡，被超聲波部分擊碎的腫瘤組裡9/11只不僅未擴散，連未處理的殘留病灶也消失——機制是釋放抗原激活了全身免疫反應。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫療技術</span><span class=\"tag\">腫瘤免疫</span>\n</div></div></a>"]